; ============================================================
;  ARMOR MAG POUCHES - crafting the chest rigs
;
;  GENERATED by art/mkcraft.py from l_amp_rigs.ltx. A rig's pockets and
;  its recipe are the same fact stated twice; deriving one from the
;  other is what stops them drifting. Change the slot counts and re-run.
;
;  Format, books and materials are the installed Mags Reloaded fork's
;  own (mod_craft_magpouches.ltx):
;      x_<section> = <tier>, <recipe book>, then material,count pairs
;
;  THE RULE: a rig's slots are bought with the magazine mod's own
;  pouches, at EXACTLY the rate a fitted pouch grants them in game -
;
;      small pouch  -> one 2x1
;      medium pouch -> two 2x1
;      large pouch  -> one 2x2
;
;  so a rig costs what it would cost to reach that shape by bolting
;  pouches onto a strap, which is what a rig is.
;
;  AND WHAT NO POUCH SELLS IS PAID FOR IN CLOTH, per square. No pouch
;  grants a 3x1 or a 1x1 - those are sewn into the harness itself, and
;  they are what makes the better rigs better at a mixed loadout. A 3x1
;  is three squares of cloth and a 1x1 is one, so the 6Sh92's four
;  mixed rows cost what they are worth instead of what a bandage pocket
;  costs.
;
; Patrontash             1 2x2 / 0 3x1 / 1 2x1 / 3 1x1  ->  2 pouches, 3 cells paid in cloth
; Razvedka Sling         0 2x2 / 2 3x1 / 1 2x1 / 3 1x1  ->  1 pouch, 9 cells paid in cloth
; Barakholka Rig         0 2x2 / 2 3x1 / 2 2x1 / 4 1x1  ->  1 pouch, 10 cells paid in cloth
; Cordon Rig             2 2x2 / 0 3x1 / 1 2x1 / 3 1x1  ->  3 pouches, 3 cells paid in cloth
; Vydra Swamp Rig        2 2x2 / 0 3x1 / 3 2x1 / 3 1x1  ->  3 pouches, 5 cells paid in cloth
; 6Sh92 Surplus Rig      0 2x2 / 4 3x1 / 1 2x1 / 4 1x1  ->  1 pouch, 16 cells paid in cloth
; Vepr Nylon Rig         1 2x2 / 2 3x1 / 2 2x1 / 4 1x1  ->  2 pouches, 10 cells paid in cloth
; Karkas Field Harness   1 2x2 / 2 3x1 / 4 2x1 / 4 1x1  ->  3 pouches, 10 cells paid in cloth
; Bastion Patrol Rig     2 2x2 / 2 3x1 / 2 2x1 / 4 1x1  ->  3 pouches, 10 cells paid in cloth
; Smersh-AK              3 2x2 / 0 3x1 / 3 2x1 / 3 1x1  ->  4 pouches, 5 cells paid in cloth
; Volya Raider Rig       3 2x2 / 2 3x1 / 0 2x1 / 4 1x1  ->  3 pouches, 10 cells paid in cloth
; Lifchik                1 2x2 / 4 3x1 / 1 2x1 / 4 1x1  ->  2 pouches, 16 cells paid in cloth
; Leshy                  1 2x2 / 4 3x1 / 2 2x1 / 4 1x1  ->  2 pouches, 16 cells paid in cloth
; Tarzan-M22             2 2x2 / 2 3x1 / 3 2x1 / 4 1x1  ->  3 pouches, 12 cells paid in cloth
; Rubezh Carrier         2 2x2 / 2 3x1 / 4 2x1 / 4 1x1  ->  4 pouches, 10 cells paid in cloth
; Shturm Carrier         4 2x2 / 2 3x1 / 0 2x1 / 4 1x1  ->  4 pouches, 10 cells paid in cloth
; ============================================================

